# Cryptic Command at a spell on the stack (the operator, 2026-10-11). Seat 1
# (ai keys) has an uncontested Main Phase 1 and a free creature to cast; seat
# 0 (human keys) holds Cryptic Command and exactly the mana for it, so once
# Memnite is on the stack seat 0 counters it and draws ("choose two"). Seat 1
# also casts Dark Ritual (no question of its own) over Memnite, so the target
# is a real choice of two spells, as it was in the reported game; one spell
# would be no question, and is answered for the seat in every mode.
